{
  "id": "1CH.7",
  "number": "7",
  "bookId": "1CH",
  "reference": "1 Int 7",
  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN",
  "verseCount": 40,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "7",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "1CH 7"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "7",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Eishoi e Isaakar",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilayiok le Isaakar; Tola, o Pua o Yashub, o Shimron, lelo pokira oong'uan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilayiok le Tola, Usi, o Refaia, o Yeriel, o Yahamai, o Ibsam, o Shemuel, ninche ilukuny oo nkajijik oo loo menye, aa taa Tola, Lmurran magil too lporori lenye. Ore esiana enye too nkolong'i e Daudi naa nkalifuni tikitam oare o iip ile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilayiok le Usi: Israhia. Ore ilayiok le Israma naa: Mikael, o Obadia, o Yoel, o Ishia, lelo pokira imiet, naa iltung'ana kituaak pooki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore tenebo ninche too iishoritin enye, terisioroto oo nkajijik oo loo menye, naa iltimito le njore, nkalifuni tomoni uni oile, amu eeta apa ninche nkituaak kumok o layiok. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore iltung'ana lenye ootii ilmareita le Isaakar naa nkalifuni ntomoni isiet oopishana pooki, ilmurran magil, eigeroki nkarn enye anaa iishoritin.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Eishoi e Benchamen o ene Dan",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilayiok le Benchamen: Bela, o Besher, o Yediael, lelo pokira okuni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilayiok le Bela: Esron, o Usi, o Usiel o Yerimot o Iri, lelo pokira imiet, ilukuny oo nkajijik oo loo menye, ilmurran magil. Ore enkigeroto enye anaa too iishoritin enye naa nkalifuni tikitam oare o tomoni uni oong'uan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilayiok le Beker: Semira o Yoash, o Eliesa, o Elioenai, o Omori, o Yeremot, o Abija o Anatot o Alemet. Ore apa kulo pooki naa ilayiok le Beker.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore enkigeroto oo nkarn enye te risioroto oo iishoritin enye, anaa lukuny oo nkajijik oo loo menye, lelo murran magil naa nkalifuni tikitam o iip are. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilayiok le Yediel: Bilhan. Ore ilayiok le Bilhan naa Yeush o Benchamen, o Ehud, o Shenana, Sesan, o Tarshish o Ahishahar. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilayiok le Yediel kulo pooki te risioroto oo lukuny oo nkajijik oo loomenye, ilmurran magil ninche. Nkalifuni tomon oopishana o iip are esiana enye, ilooterretenate to larrabal. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore Shupim o Hupim naa ilayiok le Iri, ore Hushim naa obo loo layiok le Aher.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Eishoi e Naftali",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilayiok le Naftali: Yahasiel, o Guni, o Yeser, o Shalum, ilo le ishoi e Bilhal.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Eishoi e Manase",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilayiok le Manase: Asriel laa ninye apa etoikio enkapiani enye e Aramean, etoiuo sii apa Makir menye le Gilead. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eyamaka sii apa Makir Hupim o Shupim. Ore enkarna e nkanashe enye naa Maaka. Ore enkarna e nkanashe enye e are naa Selofehad; neiu apa Selofehad ntoyie. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore Maaka ina kitok e Makir neiu olayioni, neisho enkarna ajo Peres, ore enkarna o lalashe lenye naa Sheresh: Ore ilayiok lenyena naa Olam o Rakem. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilayiok le Ulam: Bedan. Kulo apa ilayiok le Gilead ole Makir, olayioni le Manase. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore enkanashe enye Hamoleket neiu Ishod, o Abiesa, o Mahala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore ilayiok le Shemida naa Ahian, o Shekem, o Likihi o Aniam.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Eishoi e Efraim",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilayiok le Efraim: Shutela, o Bered, olayioni lenye, o Tahat olayioni lenye, o Eleada olayioni lenye, o Tahat olayioni lenye, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "o Sabad olayioni lenye, o Shutela olayioni lenye, o Eser o Elead laa ninche apa ootasesekuana iltung'ana le Gat apa ootoiwuoki teina kop, enkaraki naetuo ninche aaibung nkishu enye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neishiraki ninche Efraim papaai lenye nkolong'i kumok nepuonu ilalashera lenye aaitagol ninche. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nelo Efraim ayiolou enkitok enye, nenutayu ninye neiu enkayioni, neisho ninye enkarna ajo, Beria, enkaraki natijing'a entorroni atua enkaji enye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore entito enye naa keji Sheera, naa ninye apa natesheta Betoron e abori o ene shumata o Usensheera. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rafan apa olayioni lenye, o Rashef olayioni lenye o Tela, olayioni lenye, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "o Ladan olayioni lenye o Amihud olayioni lenye, o Elishama, olayioni lenye ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "o Nuni olayioni lenye o Yoshua olayioni lenye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore apa emanyisho enye o masaa enye naa Betel o nkang'itie enyena kutiti, o enkalo oloo saen le Naaran, o enkalo o loo ntoluo le Geser o nkang'itie enyena kutiti o Shekem o nkang'itie enyena kutiti, o Aya o nkang'itie enyena kutiti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tenebo sii ilpolosien loo le Manase, o Betshean tenebo nkang'itie enyena kutiti, o Taanak o nkang'itie enyena kutiti, o Dor o nkang'itie enyena kutiti. Kunen apa neemanya ilayiok le Yosef ole Israel.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Eishoi e Asheri",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilayiok le Asheri: Imna, o Ishfa o Ishfi, o Beria o enkanashe enye Sera. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilayiok le Beria: Heber o Malkiel, laa ninche apa iloomenye le Birsait. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Herber apa menye le Yafet, o Shomer, o Hatam, o enkanashe enye Shua. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilayiok le Yafet: Pasak, o Bimhal, o Ashfat. Kulo ninche ilayiok le Yafet. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilayiok le Shemer olalashe lenye: Roga, o Yehuba, o Aram. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilayiok le Helem olalashe lenye: Sofa, o Imna, o Shelesh, o Amal. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilayiok le Sofa: Sua, o Harnefen o Shual, o Beri, o Imra, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "o Beser, o Hod, Shama, o Shilsha, o Iltran, o Beera. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilayiok le Yater: Yefune o Pispa o Ara. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilayiok le Ula: Ara, o Hamiel, o Risia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore kulo pooki naa iltung'ana le Asheri, ilukuny oo nkajijik oo loo menye, ilootonyorrayioki naa ilmurran magil, ilarikok loo lkituaak. Ore esiana enye anaa too iishoritin enye tenkaraki enkisiaayiare o larrabal, naa iltung'ana nkalifuni tikitam o ile.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.40"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
